flowchart BT
  subgraph onchain[On-chain · Solidity]
    direction LR
    MP[MasterSmartPolicy] -->|authorizes mint| NMT[ChoreographyNMT<br/>ERC-721]
    NMT -->|creates and owns| CMA[ChoreographyMutableAsset]
    NMT -->|tokenURI| TR[ChoreographyTokenURIRenderer]
    TR -->|reads| CMA
    NMT -.->|immutable| MC[Model contract<br/>SSTORE2]
    MC -->|read at mint| CMA
    CP[CreatorSmartPolicy] -->|authorizes and constrains<br/>updates| CMA
    HP[HolderSmartPolicy] -->|second approval| CMA

    subgraph part[Participant licenses]
      PMP[ParticipantMasterSmartPolicy] -->|"① mint: issuer of the type<br/>⑤ transfer: buyer qualified"| PNMT[ParticipantNMT<br/>ERC-721, type SpecialCarrier]
      PNMT -->|"① creates<br/>④ transfers A → B"| LIC["ParticipantMutableAsset<br/>SpecialCarrier license<br/><i>⑥ on transfer: name, profile := 0,<br/>holder policy := address(0)</i>"]
      AM[ChoreographyParticipantAM<br/>SpecialCarrier licenses] -->|"③ type of the license"| LIC
    end
    CMA -->|"② role Special Carrier = license"| LIC
    CP -->|"③ participantTypeOf"| AM
  end

  subgraph offchain[Off-chain · JavaScript and actors]
    direction TB
    subgraph update[Update]
      direction LR
      U[BPMN updates] --> A[apply-asset-delta.js]
    end
    subgraph render[Render]
      direction LR
      R[web3.js +<br/>bpmn-builder-js] --> X[Regenerated BPMN]
    end
    subgraph roles[Role licenses]
      direction LR
      AU[Authority] ~~~ CA[Carrier A]
    end
    subgraph init[Init]
      direction LR
      B[Source BPMN] --> I[Importer<br/>import-bpmn.js]
      I --> D[NMT dataset<br/>.nmt.json]
      D --> M[choreography-model.js<br/>abi.encode]
    end
  end

  init ~~~ update
  init ~~~ render
  init ~~~ roles
  init -->|deploys the model contract| onchain
  update -->|"setRoles + setNodes on the asset<br/>(② links the license)"| onchain
  render -->|"reads tokenURI: JSON (roles + nodes)"| onchain
  roles -->|"① mint<br/>④ transferFrom(A, B)"| onchain

  classDef initNode fill:#E3F0FB,stroke:#3A6EA5
  classDef updateNode fill:#FFF1DB,stroke:#C98A1B
  classDef renderNode fill:#E6F4EA,stroke:#3C8D50
  classDef partNode fill:#F1E8FA,stroke:#7B4FA6
  class B,I,D,M initNode
  class U,A updateNode
  class R,X renderNode
  class AU,CA,PMP,PNMT,LIC,AM partNode
  style init fill:#F2F8FD,stroke:#3A6EA5
  style update fill:#FFF8EC,stroke:#C98A1B
  style render fill:#F1F9F3,stroke:#3C8D50
  style roles fill:#F8F3FC,stroke:#7B4FA6
  style part fill:#F8F3FC,stroke:#7B4FA6
